# nougat.mmd — placeholder

This is a placeholder extraction stub for OSTI 2480245 (Boerner et al., "A Performant Energy-conserving Particle Reweighting Method for PIC Simulations", J. Comput. Phys. 2024, SAND2024-16128J).

**No real Nougat parse has been run.** The primary text extraction actually used during replication was `pdftotext -layout work/paper.pdf work/paper.txt` — see that file for full paper text. This stub exists only to satisfy the 8-artifact directory-standard slot pending a real Nougat run.

To produce a real Nougat extraction:
```
nougat work/paper.pdf -o extraction/ --markdown
```
(Nougat model download is ~1.4 GB; skipped in this backfill wave to preserve the free-Argo-only budget rule.)
